Third-party notices

This project downloads (but does not redistribute) the following models at
runtime via `scripts/fetch_models.py`. Their licenses apply to the downloaded
files, not to this repository:

- U^2-Net (`AI-ModelScope/u2net`) — Apache-2.0, © the U^2-Net authors.
- RMBG-2.0 (`AI-ModelScope/RMBG-2.0`) — see the model card on ModelScope for
  its license terms, which restrict commercial use.

Generated pet projects embed the Rust runtime template under `pet-runtime/`,
which is covered by this MIT license. Sprite assets produced by third-party
AI services are subject to those services' terms.
